{"title":"Best Sellers","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"terra-fit-smart-watch","title":"Terra Fit Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"599\"\u003eThe Terra Fit Smartwatch is designed for active lifestyles that demand reliability, smart connectivity, and everyday comfort. With Bluetooth calling support, health tracking essentials, and a durable sporty build, Terra Fit helps you stay connected, track your fitness, and manage daily tasks effortlessly—whether you’re working out, commuting, or unwinding.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"899\"\u003eBuilt around a practical full-touch display and powered by a single-chip Bluetooth calling system, Terra Fit delivers smooth performance with essential smart features that matter most. Its long battery life, water resistance, and fitness-focused tools make it a dependable companion for daily wear.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":51181307920662,"sku":"22850","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":44679171735830,"sku":"18564","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Grey","offer_id":44679171768598,"sku":"18577","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":44679171703062,"sku":"18576","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":44679171834134,"sku":"18575","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Olive Green","offer_id":44679171801366,"sku":"18578","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_df601d00-3118-441f-ac86-ce5b8f69a31a.webp?v=1776933536"},{"product_id":"revolt-smart-watch","title":"Revoltt Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eStep into luxury with Revoltt Smart Watch: Sleek Stainless Steel, Durable Metallic Body, \u0026amp; Advanced Health Suite. Premium tech for your elite lifestyle!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eRevolt Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revolt Smartwatch is designed for those who demand cutting-edge technology and sleek design in their wearable devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis your ultimate tool for staying connected, tracking your health, and boosting your daily productivity. Whether you're in a meeting, at the gym, or out with friends, the Revolt Smartwatch fits effortlessly into your routine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Revolt Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revolt Smartwatch comes with a robust set of features to keep you ahead. Track your fitness with precision using its advanced sensors for heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and various sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with smart notifications for calls, texts, and apps, all visible on a clear, high-resolution display. The long-lasting battery ensures you’re always ready for action, and with customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps, you can easily match your watch to your outfit and mood.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Revolt Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.4-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 400 x 400 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 47 x 39 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the 