 texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: Long-lasting, multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization\u003c\/strong\u003e: Multiple customizable watch faces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatches\u003c\/a\u003e and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47069797450006,"sku":"20081","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":47069797548310,"sku":"20080","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":47069797515542,"sku":"20084","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink Gold","offer_id":47069797482774,"sku":"20077","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":48148570308886,"sku":"20680","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Sporty Gray Rings","offer_id":48926634311958,"sku":"22477","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Sporty Red Rings","offer_id":48926630936854,"sku":"22479","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Luna-_5_3.webp?v=1776510284"},{"product_id":"infinity-smartwatch","title":"Infinity Smartwatch","description":" \u003ch2\u003eInfinity Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        A seamless blend of technology and style crafted to elevate your everyday life. Infinity Smartwatch is designed for the modern individual, this sleek smartwatch offers unparalleled functionality and aesthetics, making it the perfect companion for both work and play.   \n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Whether you're tracking your fitness goals, staying connected on the go, or simply looking to make a fashion statement, the Infinity Smartwatch has you covered.\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Infinity Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Experience the future of wearable tech with the Infinity Smartwatch's impressive array of features.  \n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Stay on top of your health with its advanced fitness tracking capabilities, including heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and activity tracking.  \n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Never miss a beat with smart notifications for calls, messages, and social media updates directly on your wrist.\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        The Infinity Smartwatch also boasts a long-lasting battery life, ensuring you're always powered up for your next adventure. \n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Its customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps allow you to personalize your look to match any occasion.\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Infinity Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Display: 1.4-inch IPS full touch screen\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Resolution: 240 x 240 Pixels\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Sensors: Heart rate monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Compatibility: iOS and Android\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Strap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Dimensions: 44 x 38 x 10.7mm\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Battery Life: Up to 7 days\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Water Resistance: IP68 rating\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Weight: 38g\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Infinity SmartWatch? \u003c\/h2\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Choosing the Infinity Smartwatch means embracing a lifestyle of convenience and sophistication. \n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        With its robust set of features, exceptional build quality, and stylish design, this smartwatch stands out as a top contender in the market. \n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        It not only helps you stay organized and active but also adds a touch of elegance to your everyday ensemble. \n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures you have a seamless experience from purchase to usage.\n    \u003c\/p\u003e \n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rose Gold","offer_id":48340258521366,"sku":"20456","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":48340258488598,"sku":"20455","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":48340258455830,"sku":"20454","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Infinity_slvr.webp?v=1729678902"},{"product_id":"delta-smartwatch","title":"Delta Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eStyle up the smarter side of life with the Delta Smartwatch, featuring the largest 2.04” HD Curved Display in Smartwatches. Powered by a 3D Curved Smart Display and a Metallic Frame with a fully functional Rotating Crown, Delta includes an Active Health Suite and a 5 Day Battery Life to ensure you’re connected at every pulse.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Delta:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2.04” HD Curved Display\u003cbr\u003e3D Smart Display\u003cbr\u003eMetallic Frame\u003cbr\u003eActive Health Suite\u003cbr\u003e5 Day Battery Life\u003cbr\u003eWorkout Modes\u003cbr\u003eHeart Rate Monitor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Delta:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: Full-color touch screen.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eActivity Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: Long-lasting, multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization\u003c\/strong\u003e: Multiple customizable watch faces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":48697196675350,"sku":"20608","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Masala Red","offer_id":48697196740886,"sku":"20612","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gray Gun Metal","offer_id":48697196708118,"sku":"20613","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/blackgold_3_b4feec76-b7e0-42d2-b65d-61e4358cefa8.png?v=1733741145"},{"product_id":"carbon-earbuds","title":"Carbon Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eCarbon Earbuds with super loud sound and Environmental Noise Cancellation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eCarbon Earbuds Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover unparalleled sound quality with Carbon Earbuds. These earbuds are designed for those who seek both high-performance audio and comfort. Ideal for any activity, Carbon Earbuds deliver an outstanding listening experience whether you're on the go or at home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Carbon Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCarbon Earbuds provide rich, immersive sound with enhanced bass and clear treble. With built-in noise reduction, you can enjoy your music without interruption.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe lightweight and ergonomic design ensures a secure and comfortable fit, while touch controls allow for easy music and call management. The long-lasting battery life ensures you stay connected longer, and the sleek charging case provides additional power for extended use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Carbon Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 7 hours (up to 28 hours with charging case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging Time: 1.5 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNoise Cancellation: Yes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWaterproof Rating: IPX5\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 47 x 39 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 50g (with case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatible with: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Carbon Earbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuantum Earbuds provide exceptional sound quality and comfort, making them the perfect choice for any audio lover. With advanced features like noise cancellation and long battery life, these earbuds stand out in the market. The sleek and modern design adds a touch of style to your audio experience, making them suitable for any setting. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures you have a smooth experience from purchase to everyday use.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":48768395870486,"sku":"20392","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Dark Green","offer_id":48768395903254,"sku":"20482","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Light Gray","offer_id":48768395936022,"sku":"20480","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/JX98-01.webp?v=1765806286"},{"product_id":"revoltt-pro-smartwatch","title":"Revoltt Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eRevolttt Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe revolttt Pro is a cutting-edge smartwatch designed to seamlessly blend health, connectivity, and style. Featuring a sleek AMOLED display, it provides crystal-clear visuals and exceptional battery life, allowing you to stay connected for up to 5 days with a single charge. Whether you're tracking your heart rate, monitoring your sleep, or controlling your music, the revoltt Pro brings modern tech to your wrist with a sporty design that suits every lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Revolttt Pro\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revolttt Pro combines performance and style with an AMOLED display (1.43 inches, 466x466 resolution) for vibrant visuals and easy navigation across 8 menu styles. Equipped with Bluetooth 5.3, it offers seamless connectivity for calls, messaging alerts, and synchronization with your phone’s contact list.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003efeatures multiple health monitoring functions, including heart rate, blood pressure, SP02, sleep monitoring, and more, ensuring you stay on top of your health at all times. The built-in Google and Siri Voice Assistants offer added convenience, while the diverse sports modes and the ability to control music directly from the watch make it perfect for both fitness and entertainment enthusiasts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a water resistance rating of IP67, a durable metal and plastic body, and a stainless steel strap, the Revoltt Pro is both stylish and functional. Plus, with up to 5 days of battery life, you can keep up with your busy schedule without constant recharging.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Revoltt Pro\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 1.43 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: AMOLED\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResolution: 466 x 466\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Calling Chip: Single chip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTransmission Range: 10 meters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSynchronize Contact Book\/Calls: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncoming Call\/Messaging Alert: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSensors\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate: HX3605\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePedometer: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSP02 Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOxygen Monitor: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking (female): Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathing Training: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharge Time: 150 minutes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorking Time: 5 days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandby Time: 480 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Type: 671927\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Method: 2-pins magnet cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePhysical Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 55.00*49.00*14.00 mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBody Material: Metal + Plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStrap Material: Stainless Steel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 66g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: IP67\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Faces: 100+ Cloud, 5+1 Built-in, Animated Support\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSports Modes: 5 Cloud, 107 Built-in\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanguages: 12+ (including English, Spanish, French, Arabic, etc.)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGames: 4 (Flappy Bird, 2048, Whack-A-Mole, Thunder Fighter)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoice Assistants: Google, Siri\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMusic Control: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeather Updates: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOther Features: Alarm, Flash Light, Calculator, DND Mode, Pedometer, Sedentary Reminder, Water Reminder\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Revoltt Pro\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revoltt Pro is your ultimate wrist companion for fitness, productivity, and entertainment. Its stylish, durable design, along with robust health tracking capabilities and seamless connectivity, makes it the ideal choice for those who demand the best in wearable tech. Whether you're at the gym, in a meeting, or on the go, the Revoltt Pro keeps you connected, healthy, and in control.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gun Metal","offer_id":49534031266070,"sku":"22409","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":49534031200534,"sku":"22411","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Champagne Gold","offer_id":49534031167766,"sku":"22407","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":49534031233302,"sku":"22805","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/02_14d4c7f7-c21c-49be-8519-5f340b58ebd5.webp?v=1734007033"},{"product_id":"icon-smartwatch","title":"Icon Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eIcon Smartwatch Overview\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Icon Smartwatch combines advanced technology with a sleek design, offering a premium wearable experience. Equipped with a 1.38-inch TFT HD display, this smartwatch provides clear visuals and easy navigation. It features a range of health tracking capabilities such as dynamic heart rate monitoring, SpO2 measurement, and sleep tracking, helping you maintain your fitness goals. With an impressive battery life and a variety of smart features like quick dial pad, camera control, and smart notifications, the Icon Smartwatch is the perfect blend of functionality and style for tech enthusiasts and fitness lovers alike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Icon Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStylish design with a 1.38-inch TFT HD display.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExtensive health monitoring features, including dynamic heart rate, SpO2, sleep tracking, and more.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffers customizable watch faces with 4 built-in options and 100+ cloud-based watch faces.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupports multiple sports modes for an active lifestyle.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdvanced \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmart watches\u003c\/a\u003e features like quick dial pad, camera control, smart notifications, and more.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Icon Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay Size: 1.38 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eScreen Type: TFT HD Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenu View Styles: 2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle Chip BT Calling\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Life: 7 Days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePhysical Specifications:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShape: Square\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance Rating: IP68\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRadiant Brightness\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHealth Monitoring Features:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDynamic Heart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFemale Health Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSmart Features:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Faces: 4 Built-in, 100+ Cloud-based\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSports Modes: 100+\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuick Dial Pad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart Notifications\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlarm, Timer, Stopwatch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Icon Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Monitoring:\u003c\/strong\u003e Keep track of essential health metrics such as heart rate, SpO2, and sleep, ensuring that you stay informed about your well-being.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Connectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stay connected with features like quick dial pad, camera control, and smart notifications right from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurable \u0026amp; Stylish:\u003c\/strong\u003e Featuring a sleek design and water resistance rating of IP68, the Icon Smartwatch combines style with robustness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":49669428314390,"sku":"22851","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":49669428379926,"sku":"22853","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Space Blue","offer_id":49669428347158,"sku":"22852","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":49669428412694,"sku":"22856","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Grey","offer_id":49669428445462,"sku":"22877","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/b1.webp?v=1755342500"},{"product_id":"regal-smartwatch","title":"Regal AI Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Regal Smartwatch is an elegant fusion of style and innovation. Its sleek, modern design and durable construction make it a versatile accessory for any occasion, whether you're at work, out casually, or hitting the gym.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Sleek, modern finish with sturdy construction.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVivid AMOLED Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch screen with customizable menu views.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of regular use and up to 25–30 days on standby. Quick 2-hour charging.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking:\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Level Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStress Management Tools\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e107 Sports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tracks performance across various activities including running, cycling, and yoga.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStay Connected:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handle calls, messages, and notifications from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Compatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e Interact with Google Assistant or Siri.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt-In Entertainment:\u003c\/strong\u003e Includes 4 fun games like Flappy Bird and 2048.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEveryday Tools:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alarms, weather updates, flashlight, and calculator.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch AMOLED screen.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of regular use, 25–30 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e Heart rate monitor, blood pressure tracker, SpO2 level measurement, sleep tracking, stress management, menstrual cycle tracking.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e 107 modes including running, cycling, yoga.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Calls, messages, notifications, music playback, call records, find phone.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Google Assistant, Siri.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGames:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4 built-in games.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Tools:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alarms, weather updates, flashlight, calculator.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Regal Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Regal \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis the perfect blend of sophistication and smart innovation. With its stylish design, comprehensive health tracking features, and a suite of practical and entertainment tools, it seamlessly fits into your daily life. Whether you're focused on fitness, staying organized, or just having some fun, the Regal Smartwatch is your ideal companion, ready to step into the future with you!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Copper Silver","offer_id":50270222516502,"sku":"22552","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Obsidian Gold","offer_id":50372312826134,"sku":"22554","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rose Gold","offer_id":49685919531286,"sku":"22550","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Aqua Silver","offer_id":49685919465750,"sku":"22556","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Emerald Silver","offer_id":49685919432982,"sku":"22558","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Racing Red Silver","offer_id":49685919498518,"sku":"22548","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/CopperSilver_1.webp?v=1756127463"},{"product_id":"robo-earbuds","title":"Robo Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1\u003eRobo Earbuds\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRobo Earbuds are compact, stylish, and high-performance, designed for a stylish and snug fit. Available in \u003cstrong\u003eJet Black, Midnight Blue, and Milky White\u003c\/strong\u003e, their lightweight and compact build makes them ideal for all-day wear, whether you're at work, in the gym, or just relaxing.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Robo Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eComfortable and Modern Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Lightweight and compact, designed for a stylish and snug fit.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePowerful Battery for Non-Stop Entertainment:\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Playtime:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 42 hours with the charging case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSingle Charge:\u003c\/strong\u003e 6–8 hours of music or calls\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 180 days without frequent recharging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully charged in just 1.5 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEffortless Wireless Connectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Latest Bluetooth 5.3 provides a quick and stable connection up to 10 meters with True Wireless Stereo (TWS) for seamless syncing.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eImmersive Sound \u0026amp; Crystal-Clear Calls:\u003c\/strong\u003e 13mm drivers for rich and powerful audio, built-in noise reduction technology for clear calls, and IPX4 water resistance for durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart and Simple Touch Controls:\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlay\/Pause Music\u003c\/strong\u003e: Tap once\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncrease Volume\u003c\/strong\u003e: Tap the right earbud three times\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDecrease Volume\u003c\/strong\u003e: Tap the left earbud three times\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant (Siri\/Google)\u003c\/strong\u003e: Press and hold for four seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGaming Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Tap the left earbud four times\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer\/Hang Up Calls\u003c\/strong\u003e: Tap twice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Robo Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eColors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black, Blue, White\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e Total playtime of up to 42 hours, 6–8 hours on a single charge, 180 days standby time\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.5 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Bluetooth 5.3, True Wireless Stereo (TWS), up to 10 meters range\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAudio:\u003c\/strong\u003e 13mm drivers, built-in noise reduction technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Controls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Play\/pause, volume control, voice assistant activation, gaming mode, call control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose Robo Earbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Robo Earbuds offer a perfect blend of style, comfort, and advanced technology. Whether you’re listening to music, taking calls, or using voice assistants, these earbuds are built to enhance your daily experience. With powerful battery life, effortless wireless connectivity, immersive sound, and smart touch controls, Robo Earbuds are designed to upgrade your sound and keep you connected all day long.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExperience the ultimate listening experience with Robo Earbuds today!\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Milky White","offer_id":49727514968342,"sku":"23414","price":11499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":49727514902806,"sku":"23412","price":11499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":50340294197526,"sku":"23413","price":11499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Robo_Silver_1.webp?v=1742691968"},{"product_id":"display-earbuds","title":"Display Earbuds","description":"\u003ch3\u003eDisplay Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle combine cutting-edge technology with sleek design, offering superior sound, unmatched comfort, and innovative smart features. Whether you’re looking to elevate your music, calls, or gaming experience, these earbuds are designed to meet every need, offering the ultimate in wireless freedom.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures of Display Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eElegant Design Meets Everyday Comfort\u003c\/strong\u003e: Available in four stunning colors—Black, Blue, Green, and Champagne. Designed for a snug and secure fit, offering unmatched comfort even during extended use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImmersive Sound Experience\u003c\/strong\u003e: High-definition audio decoding with a quad-microphone ENC system for premium sound quality in music and calls, even in noisy environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInteractive Smart Screen\u003c\/strong\u003e: Built into the charging case for easy browsing, managing, and customizing settings. Select wallpapers, music, set timers, and more on a single screen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOnboard Storage\u003c\/strong\u003e: 100 minutes of onboard audio storage allows you to enjoy your favorite tracks anywhere, anytime, without a phone.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAll-Day Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: 6 hours of playtime on a single charge, 30 hours total with the charging case. Fast-charging technology ensures a full charge in just 1 hour.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.4 with Popup Pairing, Auto-Pairing, and Hyper Sync technology for lag-free performance up to 10 meters.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLow-Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Ultra-low latency of 50–60 ms for smooth and responsive gameplay.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntuitive Touch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e: Simple gestures for play\/pause, volume control, skip tracks, activate Siri\/Google Assistant, and enter Game Mode.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt for Your Active Lifestyle\u003c\/strong\u003e: IPX4 water resistance rating for workouts, light rain, or everyday adventures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications of Display Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColors\u003c\/strong\u003e: Black, Blue, Green, Champagne.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio\u003c\/strong\u003e: High-definition audio decoding, quad-microphone ENC system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: 6 hours playtime on a single charge, 30 hours total with case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 hour.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.4, Popup Pairing, Auto-Pairing, Hyper Sync technology.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInteractive Screen\u003c\/strong\u003e: Settings customization, battery status check, wallpaper selection, music browsing, timers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Control\u003c\/strong\u003e: Play\/pause, volume control, skip tracks, Siri\/Google Assistant activation, Game Mode.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Rating\u003c\/strong\u003e: IPX4.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Accessories\u003c\/strong\u003e: Display Earbuds, charging case with interactive smart screen, custom-fit eartips, USB charging cable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose the Zero Lifestyle Display Earbuds?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Display Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle combine premium performance with cutting-edge features and effortless style. Offering all-day comfort, hassle-free pairing, low-latency gaming, and a customizable smart screen, these earbuds are designed to enhance every moment of your day. Whether you’re streaming, gaming, or enjoying music on the go without your phone, the Display Earbuds provide the ultimate in wireless audio experience.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Metallic Black","offer_id":49791717409046,"sku":"23206","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Metallic White","offer_id":49791608783126,"sku":"23204","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Metallic Blue","offer_id":49791608717590,"sku":"23200","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Metallic Green","offer_id":49791608684822,"sku":"23198","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Metallic Beige","offer_id":49791608750358,"sku":"23202","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/brown.webp?v=1741777839"},{"product_id":"flair-earbuds","title":"Flair Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1\u003eIntroducing the FLAIR Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFLAIR earbuds redefine your wireless audio experience by combining advanced technology, durable design, and exceptional sound. These earbuds cater to all your daily needs—from immersive music to seamless connectivity and lasting comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"features\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of FLAIR Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Practical Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Available in Beige, Blue, Green, and Black, these lightweight earbuds (35g total weight) are designed for a snug fit. Compact dimensions ensure easy portability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eExtended Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enjoy \u003cstrong\u003e7 hours of playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e on a single charge and an impressive \u003cstrong\u003e35 hours total\u003c\/strong\u003e with the charging case. A fast-charging time of just \u003cstrong\u003e45 minutes for earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e ensures you never miss a beat.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eExceptional Sound Clarity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features high-definition audio decoding (SBC\/AAC), ENC for noise reduction, and in-ear form for a premium listening experience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLow-Latency Gaming Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e60ms ultra-low latency\u003c\/strong\u003e ensures smooth and immersive gameplay for gamers.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Technology:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offers seamless wireless connectivity up to \u003cstrong\u003e10 meters\u003c\/strong\u003e with auto-pairing and master-slave switch features for convenience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIntuitive Touch Controls:\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlay\/Pause:\u003c\/strong\u003e Double-tap any earbud.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSkip Tracks:\u003c\/strong\u003e Three taps on the left for previous or right for next track.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVolume:\u003c\/strong\u003e Click left for decrease and right for increase.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eActivate Siri\/Google Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Four taps on the right earbud.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGame Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Press and hold either earbud for 2 seconds.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer\/Reject Calls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Simple double-tap or 2-second hold, respectively.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt for Durability:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eIPX4 water resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e makes these earbuds ideal for workouts or light rain.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"specifications\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of FLAIR Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds - 31.0 x 22.0 x 22.6mm, Charging Case - 52.5 x 43.5 x 26.5mm.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40mAh (earbuds), 350mAh (charging case).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Input:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C, DC5V 75mAh.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAudio:\u003c\/strong\u003e Frequency Range - 20Hz–20kHz, Sensitivity - 110±3, Impedance - 32Ω.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Rating:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4 ensures protection against sweat and light rain.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePackaging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Includes USB Type-C charging cable and user manual.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"why-choose\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose FLAIR Earbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe FLAIR earbuds offer superior sound clarity, extended battery life, and game-ready low latency, making them perfect for music lovers, gamers, and active individuals. With IPX4 water resistance, lightweight design, and a variety of smart touch controls, these earbuds bring convenience and style together.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you're working out, gaming, or making calls, the FLAIR earbuds are built to elevate every aspect of your day!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Carbon Black","offer_id":49827088269590,"sku":"22684","price":4299.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Calm Beige","offer_id":49827088236822,"sku":"22687","price":4299.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Cool Blue","offer_id":49827088302358,"sku":"22686","price":4299.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":49827088335126,"sku":"22685","price":4299.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/carbon_black.webp?v=1770373005"},{"product_id":"jewel-smartwatch","title":"Jewel Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eJewel Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eStylish and Durable Design\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExquisitely engineered with a robust Zinc alloy shell combined with PC and ABS elements. Available in two variants—Jewel (with a lightweight profile of 30g\/44g strap options) and Jewel SE (83g with a premium steel band)—this smartwatch is built to complement your style without weighing you down.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eVivid AMOLED Display\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy a 1.1-inch AMOLED screen with a crisp 360×360 resolution that delivers vibrant visuals and excellent clarity for day-to-day interactions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eReliable Battery Performance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePowered by a polymer battery (230mAh), the Jewel \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eoffers 5–7 days of active use alongside up to 20 days on standby. A swift charge in just 2 hours gets you back on track without missing a beat.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEffortlessly manage calls, notifications, and alerts directly from your wrist. With seamless contact synchronization, call records, and split-screen functionalities, the Jewel Smartwatch ensures you never miss an important moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomize your experience using over 300 cloud-based watch faces—with 5 built-in options and DIY support—and choose from 110+ sports modes (8 built-in). Additional smart tools include voice assistant support through Google Assistant and Siri, camera control for capturing life’s moments, weather updates, alarms, calculator, LCD brightness adjustments, theater\/DND mode, motion gesture activation, and essential reminders for sedentary behavior and hydration.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay: 1.1-inch AMOLED screen with 360×360 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Life: 5–7 days of active use, 20 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Time: 2 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: IP67 rating for dependable durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperating System: Compatible with Android 5.0+ and iOS 10+ (supporting Bluetooth 4.0).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: BLE 5.0 with a 10-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Jewel Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Jewel Smartwatch offers an extraordinary blend of aesthetics, functionality, and smart connectivity. Whether you choose the classic Jewel or the premium Jewel SE, its refined design, comprehensive health tracking, and plethora of everyday tools ensure that you remain connected and in control—no matter if you’re working out, working hard, or winding down at the end of the day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Golden Milannese","offer_id":49924661870870,"sku":"22900","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold Metal","offer_id":49924662001942,"sku":"22902","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Metal","offer_id":49924662034710,"sku":"22910","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pink Leather","offer_id":49924661936406,"sku":"22906","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pearl White Leather","offer_id":49924661903638,"sku":"22904","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Milannese","offer_id":49924662067478,"sku":"22908","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Milannese","offer_id":49924661838102,"sku":"22896","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Metal","offer_id":49924661969174,"sku":"22898","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Jewel_1_57b8f293-03c2-46be-9f76-79cf4af38c09.webp?v=1773449006"},{"product_id":"storm","title":"Storm Headphones","description":"\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Storm Headphones\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eExtended Battery Life\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Storm Headphones are equipped with a robust 750mAh battery, delivering up to 70 hours of continuous playback at 60% volume and an impressive standby time of up to 6000 hours. A full recharge takes just 2–3 hours, ensuring your music experience remains uninterrupted.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBluetooth 5.0 Connectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience seamless wireless audio with Bluetooth V5.0 technology, offering a stable connection within a 10-meter range. The dual pairing feature allows you to connect and switch effortlessly between two devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSimple Pairing Process\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo pair, press and hold the Multi-Function Button (MFB) for 3 seconds until the LED indicator flashes red and blue, signaling pairing mode. Select \"Storm\" from your device's Bluetooth menu and enter “0000” if prompted. Once paired, the headphones will automatically reconnect to the device when in range.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHands-Free Convenience\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eControl your music and calls with intuitive touch features. Play\/pause, answer\/reject calls, skip tracks, and adjust volume—all at your fingertips. Activate Siri or Google Assistant by holding the MFB for 2 seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWired Option Available\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSwitch to wired mode using a 3.5mm AUX cable to conserve battery. Inserting the cable disables wireless functions, offering greater versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAudio Quality \u0026amp; Calling\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e40mm drivers deliver dynamic sound with a frequency range of 20Hz–20KHz and 32Ω impedance. The built-in microphone with -38dB±3dB sensitivity ensures clear calls and voice assistant interaction.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eCharging Indicator\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging via micro-USB is straightforward. A red LED lights up while charging and turns off once the battery is fully charged.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e V5.0\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 10 meters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/strong\u003e 70 hours (at 60% volume)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 6000 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2–3 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 750mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Drivers:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 32Ω\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20Hz–20KHz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e Yes (Siri \/ Google Assistant)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAUX Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e Yes (3.5mm cable)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Indicator:\u003c\/strong\u003e Red LED\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 181g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eColors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black, Blue, Champagne\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose Storm Headphones?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Storm Headphones offer a powerful audio experience, extended battery life, dual Bluetooth connectivity, and smart touch controls in a sleek, stylish package. Whether you're streaming music, taking calls, or using voice assistants, these headphones adapt effortlessly to your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":50007641194774,"sku":"22913","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":50724668408086,"sku":"24048","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":50007641227542,"sku":"22914","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Red","offer_id":50724668440854,"sku":"24142","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Beige","offer_id":50007641162006,"sku":"22912","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"White","offer_id":50007641260310,"sku":"22915","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/black_1_bdf97883-4dd7-4609-8119-aae71f0f5e9c.webp?v=1747123777"},{"product_id":"striker-earbuds","title":"Striker Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStriker Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSleek and Dynamic Design\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCrafted for style and comfort, the Striker Earbuds are available in three bold color choices—Black, Green, and Camo.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompact Build:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds measure 34.99 × 21.15 × 24.88 mm.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePortable Charging Case:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dimensions of 60.73 × 63.96 × 42.44 mm.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLightweight:\u003c\/strong\u003e Total weight of just 48.9 g, ensuring a comfortable fit for extended use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLong Battery Life \u0026amp; Efficient Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnjoy uninterrupted performance with a robust battery setup.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtended Playtime:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 27.5 hours in total, with approximately 5.5 hours of continuous playback at 70% volume.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully recharges in about 2 hours via a Type-C input (1W for the case, 0.5W output).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Batteries:\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by Jingshan Yifan Energy Co., Ltd. with an earbud battery capacity of 35mAh and a case capacity of 400mAh.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStandby Duration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds last about 60 days; charging case lasts up to 120 days.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience effortless pairing and uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLatest Bluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with \u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth V5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e for stable connections.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maintains connectivity within \u003cstrong\u003e≥10 meters\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHassle-Free Pairing:\u003c\/strong\u003e Supports \u003cstrong\u003eautomatic pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e for an effortless user experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGame Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Low-latency performance with \u003cstrong\u003e65ms response time\u003c\/strong\u003e for immersive gaming.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntuitive Touch \u0026amp; Voice Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnjoy easy management with sensitive touch controls.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlay\/Pause:\u003c\/strong\u003e Single tap on either earbud.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCall Handling:\u003c\/strong\u003e Answer with a tap, double-tap to hang up, long press (2–3 seconds) to reject.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Activation:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long press the \u003cstrong\u003eleft earbud\u003c\/strong\u003e (3 seconds) for Siri or Google Assistant.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGaming Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long press the \u003cstrong\u003eright earbud\u003c\/strong\u003e (3 seconds) for a low-latency experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFactory Reset:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tap \u003cstrong\u003efive times\u003c\/strong\u003e while pairing L \u0026amp; R, then place them in the case and remove to confirm reset.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSuperior Audio Experience\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImmerse yourself in powerful sound clarity.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Quality Drivers:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e13mm audio drivers\u003c\/strong\u003e deliver a frequency range of \u003cstrong\u003e20Hz–20kHz\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOptimized Sensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e111.5±3dB\u003c\/strong\u003e ensures balanced sound performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClear Calls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with a \u003cstrong\u003e2718 silicone microphone\u003c\/strong\u003e for superior voice capture.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI ENC Technology:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enhances call noise reduction for crisp conversations.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Certified \u003cstrong\u003eIPX4\u003c\/strong\u003e for protection against splashes and light rain.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEarbud Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 34.99 × 21.15 × 24.88 mm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60.73 × 63.96 × 42.44 mm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 48.9 g\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e About \u003cstrong\u003e2 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eV5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e, supports multiple protocols\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Decoding:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eSBC\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMicrophone:\u003c\/strong\u003e Single MIC\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Control:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully responsive interface\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Includes\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStriker Earbuds (Left \u0026amp; Right)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReplaceable Eartips\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Cable\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose the Striker Earbuds?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned for those who demand excellence, the Striker Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle bring together cutting-edge technology and a modern aesthetic. Whether you're making calls, gaming, or enjoying music, these earbuds are built to elevate your lifestyle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gaming Black","offer_id":50894617641238,"sku":"24765","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gaming Camou Beige","offer_id":50938794901782,"sku":"24763","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":50050472968470,"sku":"22916","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Camou Beige","offer_id":50050472870166,"sku":"22942","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Camou Gray","offer_id":50050472902934,"sku":"22917","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gaming Camou Gray","offer_id":50938794934550,"sku":"24764","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":50050472935702,"sku":"23083","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gaming-Forest Green","offer_id":51218551669014,"sku":"24872","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/02_f028c409-29ec-4027-998a-1fc1e542b4b3.webp?v=1771065090"},{"product_id":"orbit-2","title":"Orbit 2 Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch3 data-end=\"159\" data-start=\"117\"\u003eOrbit 2 Smartwatch by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"187\" data-start=\"161\"\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"361\" data-start=\"189\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"217\" data-start=\"189\"\u003eSleek and Durable Design\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"220\" data-start=\"217\"\u003eThe Orbit 2 Smartwatch is crafted to match both style and function, featuring a 1.38-inch round TFT screen with a sharp 240×240 resolution.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"362\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"362\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"364\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"382\" data-start=\"364\"\u003ePremium Build:\u003c\/strong\u003e Zinc alloy middle frame, PC plastic bottom case, and anti-static silicone strap ensure durability and comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"496\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"498\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"521\" data-start=\"498\"\u003eCompact Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designed for a perfect wrist fit without adding bulk.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"578\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"580\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"580\"\u003eIP68 Water Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Withstands daily splashes, sweat, and rain, making it ideal for workouts and outdoor adventures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"820\" data-start=\"712\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"753\" data-start=\"712\"\u003ePowerful Battery \u0026amp; Efficient Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"756\" data-start=\"753\"\u003eStay powered through busy days with a reliable battery system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"821\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"821\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"823\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"840\" data-start=\"823\"\u003eExtended Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of working time and up to 15 days on standby.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"898\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"900\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"919\" data-start=\"900\"\u003eQuick Recharge:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully charges in just 2.5–3 hours.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"957\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"959\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"980\" data-start=\"959\"\u003eReliable Battery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220mAh polymer battery with Seiko board protection for long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1182\" data-start=\"1070\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1070\"\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"1107\" data-start=\"1104\"\u003eEnjoy smooth pairing and stable connections for all your smart functions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1183\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1183\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1185\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1214\" data-start=\"1185\"\u003eLatest Bluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with BLE 5.3 for fast, reliable transmission.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1335\" data-start=\"1272\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1335\" data-start=\"1274\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1293\" data-start=\"1274\"\u003eGenerous Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maintains connectivity up to 10 meters.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1336\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1338\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1362\" data-start=\"1338\"\u003eSmart Notifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stay on top of calls, messages, and app alerts directly on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1551\" data-start=\"1442\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1480\" data-start=\"1442\"\u003eAdvanced Health \u0026amp; Fitness Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"1483\" data-start=\"1480\"\u003eTake charge of your health with comprehensive monitoring features.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1552\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1552\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1554\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1593\" data-start=\"1554\"\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (LC09 Sensor)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1649\" data-start=\"1596\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1649\" data-start=\"1598\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1647\" data-start=\"1598\"\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO₂) \u0026amp; Blood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1688\" data-start=\"1650\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1688\" data-start=\"1652\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1686\" data-start=\"1652\"\u003eSleep Monitoring (22:00–08:00)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1730\" data-start=\"1689\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1730\" data-start=\"1691\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1728\" data-start=\"1691\"\u003eBreath Training \u0026amp; Stress Function\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1791\" data-start=\"1731\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1791\" data-start=\"1733\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1789\" data-start=\"1733\"\u003ePedometer, Calories, Sedentary \u0026amp; Hydration Reminders\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1872\" data-start=\"1792\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1872\" data-start=\"1794\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1813\" data-start=\"1794\"\u003e8 Sports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Including walking, running, cycling, swimming, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1873\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1875\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1899\" data-start=\"1875\"\u003eGPS Motion Tracking:\u003c\/strong\u003e Via connected mobile app for precise activity mapping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2054\" data-start=\"1963\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1997\" data-start=\"1963\"\u003eSmart Controls \u0026amp; Customization\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"2000\" data-start=\"1997\"\u003ePacked with features that make everyday life easier.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2055\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2105\" data-start=\"2055\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2105\" data-start=\"2057\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2103\" data-start=\"2057\"\u003eBluetooth Phone Calls \u0026amp; AI Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2136\" data-start=\"2106\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2136\" data-start=\"2108\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2134\" data-start=\"2108\"\u003eCamera \u0026amp; Music Control\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2183\" data-start=\"2137\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2183\" data-start=\"2139\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2181\" data-start=\"2139\"\u003eWeather Forecast (Today + Next 6 Days)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2244\" data-start=\"2184\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2244\" data-start=\"2186\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2205\" data-start=\"2186\"\u003eDIY Watch Face:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize with your favorite photos.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2305\" data-start=\"2245\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2305\" data-start=\"2247\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2303\" data-start=\"2247\"\u003eStopwatch, Countdown Timer, Calculator, Split Screen\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2392\" data-start=\"2306\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2392\" data-start=\"2308\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2335\" data-start=\"2308\"\u003eMulti-Language Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e Including Arabic, German, Japanese, Chinese, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2393\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2395\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2417\" data-start=\"2395\"\u003eFun Gaming Feature\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2458\" data-start=\"2426\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2671\" data-start=\"2459\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2505\" data-start=\"2459\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2505\" data-start=\"2461\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2473\" data-start=\"2461\"\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.38\" TFT, 240×240 resolution\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2545\" data-start=\"2506\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2545\" data-start=\"2508\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2520\" data-start=\"2508\"\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220mAh polymer battery\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2580\" data-start=\"2546\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2580\" data-start=\"2548\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2566\" data-start=\"2548\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.5–3 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2607\" data-start=\"2581\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2607\" data-start=\"2583\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2597\" data-start=\"2583\"\u003eBluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e BLE 5.3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2638\" data-start=\"2608\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2638\" data-start=\"2610\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2631\" data-start=\"2610\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2671\" data-start=\"2639\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2671\" data-start=\"2641\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2658\" data-start=\"2641\"\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e 8 built-in\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2701\" data-start=\"2678\"\u003ePackage Includes\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2759\" data-start=\"2702\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2724\" data-start=\"2702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2724\" data-start=\"2704\"\u003eOrbit 2 Smartwatch\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2743\" data-start=\"2725\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2743\" data-start=\"2727\"\u003eCharging Cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2759\" data-start=\"2744\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2759\" data-start=\"2746\"\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"2806\" data-start=\"2766\"\u003eWhy Choose the Orbit 2 Smartwatch?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3082\" data-start=\"2807\"\u003eDesigned for modern, active lifestyles, the Orbit 2 \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatches by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/a\u003e blends advanced health monitoring, smart connectivity, and rugged durability. Whether you’re working out, staying productive, or just staying connected, the Orbit 2 is built to elevate your day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gray Silver","offer_id":50061363872022,"sku":"23116","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":50061363773718,"sku":"22808","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Coffee","offer_id":50061363839254,"sku":"23108","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":50061363806486,"sku":"23110","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Marsala Gold","offer_id":50061363904790,"sku":"23112","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pink Golden","offer_id":50061363937558,"sku":"23114","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/silver_4_35749c97-d365-44fc-aa24-b7b94532fa1a.webp?v=1776755793"},{"product_id":"arcade-beast","title":"Arcade Beast","description":"\u003ch2 data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"109\"\u003eArcade Beast by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"134\"\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"168\"\u003eSleek and Tactical Design\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"293\"\u003eBuilt for both performance and style, the \u003cstrong data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"227\"\u003eArcade Beast\u003c\/strong\u003e earbuds come in four bold colorways—Black, Grey, Blue, and White.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"506\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"353\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"353\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"315\"\u003eCompact Build:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds measure 34.3 × 20.4 × 20 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"422\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"422\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"383\"\u003ePortable Charging Case:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dimensions are 58.1 × 45.8 × 27.3 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"506\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"506\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"441\"\u003eLightweight:\u003c\/strong\u003e Total weight of just 44.53 g ensures a snug and effortless fit\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"557\"\u003eLong Battery Life \u0026amp; Efficient Charging\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"640\"\u003eGame, stream, and talk all day with powerful battery support and quick recharging.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"1086\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"694\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"694\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"663\"\u003eTotal Playtime:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 30 hours of usage time\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"760\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"760\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"724\"\u003eSingle Charge Playback:\u003c\/strong\u003e Around 6 hours at moderate volume\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"815\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"815\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"781\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully recharges in about 1 hour\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"916\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"836\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"834\"\u003ePower Setup:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"916\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"865\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"865\"\u003eType-C Input: DC 5V\/1A\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"892\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"892\"\u003eCase Input Power: 5W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"916\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"916\"\u003eCase Output: 1.2W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"1051\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"939\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"937\"\u003eBattery Specs:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1051\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"960\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"960\"\u003eEarbuds: 40mAh\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"979\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"979\"\u003eCase: 400mAh\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1051\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1051\"\u003eBattery Manufacturer: Golden Universe \/ Henan Wanli \/ Hunan Lirui\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1086\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1086\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1071\"\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 40 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1129\"\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1204\"\u003eStay connected with ultra-reliable Bluetooth and real-time responsiveness.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1269\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1269\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1230\"\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e V5.4 for faster, more stable pairing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1332\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1332\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1295\"\u003eConnectivity Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Operates smoothly within 10 meters\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1422\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1422\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1364\"\u003ePersonalized Device Name:\u003c\/strong\u003e Recognized as “\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"227\"\u003eArcade Beast\u003c\/strong\u003e”\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1422\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1422\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1448\"\u003eAdvanced Protocols:\u003c\/strong\u003e A2DP 1.4, AVRCP 1.6.2, HFP 1.7.2, and more\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1517\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1515\"\u003eSmart Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1536\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1536\"\u003eAuto Pairing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1556\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1556\"\u003ePopup Pairing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1573\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1573\"\u003eHyper Sync\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003eMaster-Slave Switching\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003eSmart Controls \u0026amp; Voice Activation\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1700\"\u003eTake control with effortless taps and voice commands.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1794\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1794\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1724\"\u003eVoice Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Activate Siri or Google Assistant with four taps on the left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1865\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1865\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1819\"\u003eTouch Interaction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully responsive interface for easy control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1899\"\u003eQuick Pairing \u0026amp; Smart Sync:\u003c\/strong\u003e Pair instantly without digging into settings\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1985\"\u003eImmersive Audio \u0026amp; Durability\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2038\"\u003eEngineered for powerful sound clarity and endurance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2233\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2116\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2116\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2062\"\u003eDriver Platform:\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by JL 7006F8 chip for clean, balanced audio\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2152\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2152\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2136\"\u003eAudio Format:\u003c\/strong\u003e SBC supported\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2233\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2233\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2176\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Splash-ready for daily wear (IPX rating not specified)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2269\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2582\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2317\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2317\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2295\"\u003eEarbud Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 34.3 × 20.4 × 20 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2373\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2373\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2349\"\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 58.1 × 45.8 × 27.3 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2403\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2403\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2393\"\u003eTotal Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 44.53 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2433\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2433\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2424\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1 hour\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2465\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2465\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2458\"\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e V5.4\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2521\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2521\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2489\"\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40mAh (earbud), 400mAh (case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2582\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2582\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2542\"\u003ePlayback Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 6 hours (single charge), 30 hours total\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2609\"\u003ePackage Includes\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2716\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2650\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2650\"\u003eArcade Beast Earbuds (Left \u0026amp; Right)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2668\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2668\"\u003eCharging Case\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2692\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2692\"\u003eReplaceable Eartips\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2716\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2716\"\u003eType-C Charging Cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2751\"\u003eWhy Choose Arcade Beast?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"3019\"\u003eLevel up your lifestyle with \u003cstrong data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2798\"\u003eArcade Beast\u003c\/strong\u003e—a bold fusion of form, power, and real-time audio performance. Built for gamers, streamers, and go-getters, these earbuds are your companion for every battle, beat drop, and call. Plug in. Lock on. Beast Mode: Activated.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Stealth Black","offer_id":50134811410710,"sku":"22932","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Thunder Blue","offer_id":50134811443478,"sku":"22936","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Convert White","offer_id":50134811377942,"sku":"22934","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gaming black","offer_id":51154447302934,"sku":"25001","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/ECOM_01.webp?v=1774945163"},{"product_id":"legacy-smartwatch","title":"Legacy Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2 data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"119\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"140\" data-start=\"119\"\u003eLegacy Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"119\"\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"143\" data-start=\"140\"\u003eThe Legacy Smartwatch combines modern utility with timeless design, engineered to elevate your everyday life. From powerful health tracking features to customizable aesthetics, this smartwatch is built for users who demand performance, comfort, and a touch of class — whether at work, in the gym, or on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"460\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"487\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"514\" data-start=\"487\"\u003eRefined \u0026amp; Robust Design\u003c\/strong\u003e: 44mm zinc alloy + plastic case, 56g weight with IP67 water resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"587\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"589\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"589\"\u003eVibrant AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e: Sharp visuals on a 1.39\" screen with brightness adjustment and always-on support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"699\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"701\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"729\" data-start=\"701\"\u003eLong Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5–7 days of regular use, 25–30 days standby with a quick 2-hour charge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"801\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"839\" data-start=\"803\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"838\" data-start=\"803\"\u003eComprehensive Health Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"842\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"842\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"844\"\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"870\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"872\"\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"900\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"902\"\u003eSpO2 Level Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"928\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"930\"\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"949\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"951\"\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"982\"\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1006\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1008\"\u003eCalorie Tracker\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1026\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1028\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1028\"\u003e120+ Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e: Covers activities from running and cycling to yoga and beyond.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1114\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1116\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1139\" data-start=\"1116\"\u003eSmart Notifications\u003c\/strong\u003e: Stay updated with call alerts, messages, reminders, and app notifications.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1216\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1249\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003eVoice Assistant Integration\u003c\/strong\u003e: Compatible with voice assistants for hands-free commands.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1309\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1311\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1338\" data-start=\"1311\"\u003eInteractive Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13 dynamic faces, including 6 animated and full DIY customization.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1407\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1409\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1409\"\u003eEntertainment on Wrist\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 built-in game (\"Plane\") for quick play.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1479\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1481\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1501\" data-start=\"1481\"\u003eDaily Essentials\u003c\/strong\u003e: Alarm, weather, flashlight, calculator, sedentary reminder, drink water prompt, camera control, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"1644\" data-start=\"1615\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1648\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1659\" data-start=\"1648\"\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: AMOLED, 1.39-inch, brightness adjustable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1704\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1715\" data-start=\"1704\"\u003eBattery\u003c\/strong\u003e: 400mAh lithium battery\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1742\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1758\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003eUsage Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5–7 days regular, 25–30 days standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1813\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003eCharging\u003c\/strong\u003e: 2 hours via magnetic suction\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1846\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1848\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1859\" data-start=\"1848\"\u003eSensors\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate (HRS3605), SpO2, Blood pressure, Accelerometer (LIS2DOCTR)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1933\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1935\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1951\" data-start=\"1935\"\u003eSports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e: 120+ activities supported\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1981\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1983\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1999\" data-start=\"1983\"\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.2, 20m range, supports calls, contacts, call records\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2068\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2070\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2089\" data-start=\"2070\"\u003eVoice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e: Google Assistant, Siri compatible\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"2127\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"2129\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2138\" data-start=\"2129\"\u003eGames\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 built-in\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2153\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2155\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2170\" data-start=\"2155\"\u003eOther Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e: Flashlight, alarm, weather, calculator, camera control, DND mode, motion gesture activation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2266\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2268\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2288\" data-start=\"2268\"\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e: IP67\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"2340\" data-start=\"2303\"\u003eWhy Choose the Legacy Smartwatch?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2688\" data-start=\"2342\"\u003eThe Legacy \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis more than just a wearable — it’s a lifestyle upgrade. Designed with precision, equipped with cutting-edge features, and built to last, it’s the perfect companion for health tracking, productivity, and staying connected. Whether you're chasing goals or winding down, Legacy adapts to your day — strong, smart, and stylish.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gold Black","offer_id":50200306778390,"sku":"20778","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":50200306745622,"sku":"20779","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Blue","offer_id":50200306811158,"sku":"22173","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/GoldBlack_2.webp?v=1765658265"},{"product_id":"snap-zbuds","title":"Snap Zbuds","description":"\u003ch3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"20\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"18\"\u003eSnap Zbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"306\"\u003eThe Snap Zbuds are engineered for music lovers and multitaskers who want powerful sound, effortless controls, and all-day comfort. With immersive audio, long-lasting battery, and seamless connectivity, Snap Zbuds are your go-to earbuds for work, workouts, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"311\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"346\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"344\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"454\"\u003e🎧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"383\"\u003eCompact \u0026amp; Lightweight Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Ergonomic earbuds with a sleek charging case for easy portability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"560\"\u003e🔊 \u003cstrong data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"478\"\u003eImmersive Audio\u003c\/strong\u003e – 12 mm dynamic drivers with SBC and AAC decoding deliver rich, balanced sound.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"681\"\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"590\"\u003eExtended Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"610\"\u003e7 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e of playtime on a single charge and \u003cstrong data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"664\"\u003e29 hours total\u003c\/strong\u003e with the case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"778\"\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"716\"\u003eQuick Charging \u0026amp; USB‑C Port\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully charges in \u003cstrong data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"747\"\u003e2 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e for uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"891\"\u003e🔗 \u003cstrong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"808\"\u003eSeamless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with 10 m range, quick auto‑pairing, and master‑slave switching.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"1023\"\u003e🎙 \u003cstrong data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"920\"\u003eClear Calls Anywhere\u003c\/strong\u003e – Dual MEMS microphones with ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation) for crystal‑clear conversations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1148\"\u003e🖐 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1064\"\u003eTouch Controls \u0026amp; Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Play\/pause, switch tracks, and activate Siri\/Google Assistant with simple taps.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1224\"\u003e💧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1179\"\u003eIPX4 Splash Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Built to withstand sweat and light rain.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1229\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1266\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1264\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1292\"\u003eEarbud Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 27.39 × 25.01 × 23.02 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1371\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1371\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1351\"\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 66 × 43.7 × 32 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1395\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1395\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1385\"\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 30.42 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1455\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1455\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1419\"\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50 mAh (earbuds) + 480 mAh (case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1516\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1516\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1471\"\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7 hours (single charge) \/ 29 hours (total)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1547\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1547\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1536\"\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 70 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1588\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1588\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1568\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours via USB‑C\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1632\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1632\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1613\"\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 (10 m range)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1659\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1659\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1647\"\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e Jieli7016\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1679\"\u003eAudio Driver:\u003c\/strong\u003e 12 mm dynamic driver\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1745\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1745\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1728\"\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20 Hz – 20 kHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1769\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1769\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1762\"\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 16 Ω\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1803\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1803\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1788\"\u003eSensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 112.5 ± 3 dB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1838\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1838\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1827\"\u003eDecoding Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e SBC, AAC\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1873\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1873\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1857\"\u003eMicrophones:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dual MEMS Mic\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1940\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1940\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1899\"\u003eNoise Cancellation:\u003c\/strong\u003e ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1964\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4 (splash‑proof)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"1991\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2025\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2023\"\u003eWhy Choose Snap Zbuds?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2409\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eSnap Zbuds are more than just wireless earbuds—they’re your all‑day companion for calls, music, and workouts. With powerful audio, reliable ENC for clear calls, and a compact design, they’re built for every moment. Whether you’re commuting, hitting the gym, or just unwinding, Snap Zbuds keep you connected and entertained without compromise.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Lavender Haze","offer_id":50335110660374,"sku":"23427","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Cool Grey","offer_id":50335110627606,"sku":"23425","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pearl White","offer_id":50335110693142,"sku":"23426","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Lavendar-Haze_2.webp?v=1771238203"},{"product_id":"lunar-360-smartwatch","title":"Lunar 360 Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eLunar 360 Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eLunar 360 Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e combines cutting-edge technology with a sleek modern design, giving you the ultimate balance of style, performance, and wellness. With its high-resolution AMOLED display, extended battery life, and advanced health monitoring, Lunar 360 is built to keep up with your lifestyle—day and night.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⌚ \u003cstrong\u003ePremium Build Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Zinc alloy electroplated middle frame, stainless steel dual buttons, and ABS+PC bottom shell with leather-TPU strap.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🖥 \u003cstrong\u003eBrilliant AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e – 1.43-inch AMOLED round screen with 466×466 resolution and full-screen touch functionality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong\u003ePowerful Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e – 300 mAh polymer lithium battery offering:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 days of typical use\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e30 days standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3 days in AOD (Always-On Display) mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eMagnetic Fast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Convenient magnetic charging method for quick and reliable power-ups.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e📱 \u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with call support, music control, notifications, and remote camera functionality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e❤️ \u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e –\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (VC30F-S Sensor)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO2)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSleep Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🏃 \u003cstrong\u003eFitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e – Multiple sport profiles supported, including running, cycling, walking, and more, with motion tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎨 \u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e – AMOLED display supports vibrant pre-installed dials and downloadable options via companion app.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🧠 \u003cstrong\u003eSmart Tools \u0026amp; Assistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Voice assistant, weather, calendar, alarm, stopwatch, timer, calculator, world clock, sedentary \u0026amp; drink reminders.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e💧 \u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – IP67 water resistance ensures safety in daily use and light water exposure.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Zinc alloy middle frame, stainless steel buttons, ABS+PC bottom shell, leather+TPU strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.43-inch AMOLED, 466×466 resolution, full-touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e RTL8773EWE-VP\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMemory:\u003c\/strong\u003e SRAM 560 KB, PSRAM 4 MB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlash:\u003c\/strong\u003e 128 Mbit\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSensors:\u003c\/strong\u003e VC30F-S heart rate \u0026amp; SpO₂ sensor, STK8321 G-sensor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 300 mAh polymer lithium (10 days use, 30 days standby, 3 days AOD mode)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Magnetic charging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 (with call support, notifications, music, and more)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 65 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 53.2 × 46.5 × 12.8 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP67\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtras:\u003c\/strong\u003e Voice assistant, remote camera, breathing exercises, business card holder, OTA software updates\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eWhy Choose Lunar 360 Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Lunar 360 \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch\u003c\/a\u003e is more than just a wearable—it’s a complete lifestyle companion. Whether you want to stay on top of your health, boost your productivity, or enjoy seamless connectivity, Lunar 360 delivers it all in a stylish, durable package. With its AMOLED display, customizable watch faces, long battery life, and IP67 water resistance, it’s built for those who demand performance, sophistication, and reliability every day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Brown Leather","offer_id":50407371014422,"sku":"23159","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gold Silicone","offer_id":50407370850582,"sku":"23162","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Silicone","offer_id":50407370981654,"sku":"23161","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Leather","offer_id":50407370948886,"sku":"23157","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green Leather","offer_id":50407371079958,"sku":"23160","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey Silver Silicone","offer_id":50407371047190,"sku":"23164","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green Silicone","offer_id":50407371112726,"sku":"23165","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Silicone","offer_id":50407370916118,"sku":"23163","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Leather","offer_id":50407370883350,"sku":"23158","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/lunar_Brown-Leather_1.webp?v=1756987036"},{"product_id":"nebula-earbuds","title":"Nebula Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1 data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"188\"\u003eNebula Earbuds\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"497\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"212\"\u003eNebula Earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e bring immersive audio and intelligent connectivity together in a sleek in-ear TWS design. With hybrid ANC, crystal-clear calling, long battery life, and sensitive touch controls, Nebula is built for music lovers, professionals, and gamers who want superior sound without compromise.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"502\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"532\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"675\"\u003e🎧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"565\"\u003ePremium Design \u0026amp; Comfort\u003c\/strong\u003e – Ergonomic in-ear TWS design with lightweight build (46 g total) and stylish color options (beige, black).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"852\"\u003e🖥 \u003cstrong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"703\"\u003eHigh-Fidelity Sound\u003c\/strong\u003e – 13 mm drivers with 32 Ω impedance, 124±1.5 dB sensitivity, 20–20,000 Hz frequency response, and dual-channel 24-bit DAC for studio-like clarity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"998\"\u003e🔊 \u003cstrong data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"883\"\u003eAdvanced Noise Control\u003c\/strong\u003e – Hybrid ANC + ENC for clear calls and immersive listening, plus transparency mode (long press right earbud 2s).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1106\"\u003e🎤 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1026\"\u003eClear Voice Calling\u003c\/strong\u003e – 6 built-in microphones ensure crisp communication and call noise reduction.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1147\"\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1143\"\u003eReliable Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e –\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1292\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1198\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1198\"\u003eEarbuds: 40 mAh each (up to 20 hours playtime)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1262\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1262\"\u003eCharging Case: 400 mAh (total 20 hours use, 5 days standby)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1292\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1292\"\u003eCharging Time: ~1.5 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1371\"\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003eConvenient Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – DC5V magnetic input (box: 5V 1A \/ 0.3A output).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1500\"\u003e📱 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1401\"\u003eSeamless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 platform with ≥10 m range, auto-pairing, quick pairing, and master-slave switch.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1554\"\u003e🧠 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1523\"\u003eSmart Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Sensitive touch functions:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1771\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1595\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1595\"\u003ePlay\/Pause: Double-tap either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1625\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1625\"\u003eVolume+: Tap right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1654\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1654\"\u003eVolume–: Tap left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1715\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1715\"\u003eVoice Assistant (Siri\/Google): Long press left earbud 2s\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1771\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1771\"\u003eGame Mode \/ Low Latency: Quadruple-tap right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1849\"\u003e💧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1800\"\u003eDurable \u0026amp; Waterproof\u003c\/strong\u003e – IPX4 rating for splash and sweat resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1854\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1886\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"2786\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1916\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1916\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1908\"\u003eProduct Model:\u003c\/strong\u003e JX116\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1945\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1945\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1930\"\u003eColors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Beige, Black\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1990\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1990\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1972\"\u003eEarphone Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 33 × 20 × 23 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2040\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2040\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2022\"\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 33 × 20 × 23 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2061\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2061\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2054\"\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 46 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2122\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2122\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2085\"\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds 40 mAh each \/ Case 400 mAh\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2155\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2155\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2144\"\u003eTotal Playtime:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2184\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2184\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2175\"\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2217\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2217\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2205\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.5 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2331\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2331\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2244\"\u003eChipset \u0026amp; Bluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e Bluetooth 5.3 + BR + EDR + BLE, supports multiple protocols (A2DP, AVRCP, HFP, etc.)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2365\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2365\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2350\"\u003eMicrophones:\u003c\/strong\u003e 6-mic system\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2408\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2408\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2384\"\u003eDriver Size:\u003c\/strong\u003e 13 mm dynamic drivers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2449\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2449\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2434\"\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20–20,000 Hz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2473\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2473\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2466\"\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 32 Ω\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2505\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2505\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2492\"\u003eSensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 124±1.5 dB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2553\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2553\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2527\"\u003eAudio Decoding:\u003c\/strong\u003e 24-bit DAC, SNR ≥102 dB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2584\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2584\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2577\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2681\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2681\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2600\"\u003eControls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Touch \u0026amp; button-based (play\/pause, calls, volume, voice assistant, gaming mode)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2786\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2786\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2700\"\u003eAccessories:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds L\/R, charging case, eartips (L\/M\/S), charging cable, color box, user manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2791\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2824\"\u003eWhy Choose Nebula Earbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"3124\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2848\"\u003eNebula Earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e are engineered for those who want more from their audio—deep bass, crisp highs, and effortless control. With hybrid ANC, IPX4 durability, 6-mic clarity, and up to 20 hours of playtime, Nebula is designed to adapt to your day, whether you’re working, gaming, or on the move.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Royal Blue","offer_id":50506882679062,"sku":"23656","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Charcoal Black","offer_id":50506882613526,"sku":"23035","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Creamy Beige","offer_id":50506882646294,"sku":"23655","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Nabula_Royal-Blue_1.webp?v=1758701929"},{"product_id":"zenith-headphones","title":"Zenith Headphones","description":"\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePackage Contains:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 1 device, 1 user manual, 1 warranty card\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eZenith Headphones\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eZenith blends premium sound engineering with timeless design, giving creators and travelers the ultimate immersive audio experience. Built for long journeys, creative sessions, and everyday use, Zenith combines powerful performance, extended playtime, and versatile functionality in a sophisticated form.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImmersive Acoustic Experience\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eZenith features a unique acoustic chamber effect that creates a deep, studio-like immersive sound environment around the listener. The result is rich, immersive sound that enhances focus and creativity anywhere.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExtended Playtime\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWith up to 70 hours of battery life, Zenith is designed to support long creative sessions, travel days, and continuous playback without frequent charging.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDual Pairing\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConnect two devices simultaneously to seamlessly switch between tasks, such as editing on a laptop and taking calls on a smartphone, without manual reconnection.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIndependent SD Card Slot\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eZenith allows music playback directly from an SD card, enabling users to enjoy their playlists without relying on a phone or external device.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExternal Speaker\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSwitch from private listening to speaker mode to share music and sound with others, transforming Zenith into a compact portable speaker.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePremium Design and Build\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eZenith features an over-the-ear cup design for extended comfort, fingerprint-resistant finishes, and a quality-build steel headband. It is available in three sophisticated colors: Chocolate Brown, Midnight Blue, and Charcoal Black.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTravel Friendly\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eZenith’s foldable-design is perfect for those who are always on-the-move, fitting seamlessly into travel setups and airport looks while providing reliable performance throughout long journeys.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e High-grade plastic body with steel headband extension and matte finish earcups\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBattery:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 800 mAh polymer lithium battery with up to 70 hours of playback time\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Bluetooth 5.3, SD card slot, dual pairing support\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCharging:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Type-C charging\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAudio:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 40mm sound drivers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWeight:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Approx. 250 g\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eColors:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Chocolate Brown, Midnight Blue, Charcoal Black\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecial Features:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Up to 70 hours playtime, Dual pairing, Independent SD card slot, upto 45MS low latency, external speaker mode, immersive chamber sound, 300-day standby time.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose Zenith Headphones\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eZenith is more than just a pair of headphones; it is an immersive studio experience on-the-go. Whether working on the go, traveling, or seeking inspiration, Zenith delivers a powerful and sound experience with exceptional endurance and versatility. Its blend of premium design, extended playtime, and multi-mode functionality makes it the ideal choice for creators, travelers, and the acoustic chamber is perfect for anyone who refuses to compromise on sound quality.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch1 data-end=\"597\" data-start=\"576\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/h1\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Carbon Black","offer_id":50550060548374,"sku":"22650","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":50550060613910,"sku":"22930","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Chocolate Brown","offer_id":50550060581142,"sku":"22931","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Zeinth-CarbonBlack_7.webp?v=1773045674"},{"product_id":"visionary-smartwatch","title":"Visionary Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contains\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e1 × ZERO Visionary Smartwatch\u003cbr\u003e1 × User Manual\u003cbr\u003e1 × Warranty Card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZERO Visionary Smartwatch\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe ZERO Visionary Smartwatch combines cutting-edge technology with a sleek modern design, giving you the ultimate balance of style, performance, and wellness. With its high-resolution AMOLED display, extended battery life, and advanced health monitoring, Visionary is built to keep up with your lifestyle day and night.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBrilliant AMOLED Display:\u003cbr\u003e1.85-inch AMOLED HD full-touch screen with stunning clarity and vibrant visuals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeamless Bluetooth Calling*  Single-chip Bluetooth 5.3 delivers stable, clear call quality directly from your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*Customizable Watch Faces* Switch between built-in dials or cloud-based designs to suit your mood and style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e *Comprehensive Health Tracking*  Real-time heart rate monitoring, SpO₂ tracking, sleep analysis, and female health tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e *Fitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes* Multiple workout profiles supported for accurate performance and activity tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Notifications \u0026amp; Controls \u003c\/strong\u003eStay updated with instant alerts and manage music, camera, and weather with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIP68 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e  Designed to handle sweat, rain, and splashes for worry-free daily wear.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePowerful Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Up to 15 days of typical use on a single charge for uninterrupted performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.85-inch AMOLED HD, full-touch screen\u003cbr\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.3 (with call support, notifications, music, and camera control)\u003cbr\u003eHealth Sensors: Heart rate, SpO₂, sleep tracking, female health monitoring\u003cbr\u003eSports: Multiple sport modes with motion tracking\u003cbr\u003eWater Resistance: IP68\u003cbr\u003eBattery Life: Up to 15 days\u003cbr\u003eCharging: Magnetic charging cable\u003cbr\u003eBuild: Stylish, durable design with premium finish\u003cbr\u003eWarranty: 365 Days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Choose ZERO Visionary?\u003cbr\u003eThe ZERO Visionary \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch in Pakistan\u003c\/a\u003e is more than just a wearable it’s your complete lifestyle companion. Whether you want to track your health, boost productivity, or enjoy seamless connectivity, Visionary delivers it all in a stylish, durable package. With its AMOLED display, customizable watch faces, long battery life, and IP68 water resistance, it’s designed for those who demand performance, sophistication, and reliability every day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Starlight Silicone","offer_id":50583080632598,"sku":"22948","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Silicone","offer_id":50583080435990,"sku":"22947","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Brown Silicone","offer_id":50583080501526,"sku":"22949","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rainbow","offer_id":50583080599830,"sku":"22950","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Olive Green Silicone","offer_id":50583080534294,"sku":"22946","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Leather","offer_id":50583080468758,"sku":"22951","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Orange Silicone","offer_id":50583080567062,"sku":"22952","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Visionary_Starlight-Silicone_1_a7706397-974f-479a-9934-13ea5327f478.webp?v=1774870143"},{"product_id":"evo-earbuds","title":"Evo Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEVO Earbuds\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe EVO Earbuds bring a bold new edge to sound and style. With a sleek metallic finish, powerful 10 mm drivers, and dual-mic ENC for crystal-clear calls, EVO is designed for those who live loud and make every beat their own. Built to match Gen Z energy, it’s where performance meets personality.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePremium Metallic Design – Glossy metallic casing with bold color options. \u003cbr\u003eLightweight 36.5 g build for everyday comfort and portability.\u003cbr\u003ePowerful Sound Performance – 10 mm dynamic drivers deliver balanced bass and crisp treble.\u003cbr\u003eENC Voice Clarity – Dual-mic Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) ensures clear calls even in noisy environments.\u003cbr\u003eBattery Performance –\u003cbr\u003eEarbuds: 40 mAh each (approx. 5–6 hours playtime)\u003cbr\u003eUp to 50 Hours total play time.\u003cbr\u003eCharging Type – Type C\u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Connectivity – Bluetooth 5.4 \u003cbr\u003eSmart Touch Controls –\u003cbr\u003ePlay\/Pause: Single-tap MFB button\u003cbr\u003eNext Track: Double-tap right earbud\u003cbr\u003ePrevious Track: Double-tap left earbud\u003cbr\u003eVolume +: Triple-tap left earbud\u003cbr\u003eVolume –: Triple-tap right earbud\u003cbr\u003eVoice Assistant (Siri \/ Google): Press and hold 2 s\u003cbr\u003eAnswer \/ Hang up Call: Single-tap MFB\u003cbr\u003eReject Call: Long-press 2 s MFB\u003cbr\u003eTurn Off: Press and hold 4 s\u003cbr\u003eWater Resistance – IPX4 Water Resistance\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging Case Dimensions: 60.1 × 48.36 × 26.6 mm\u003cbr\u003eWeight: 36.5 g (total)\u003cbr\u003eBattery Capacity: Earbuds 40 mAh each \/ Case 400 mAh\u003cbr\u003eTotal Playtime: 50 hours\u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.4 \u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Range: 10 m\u003cbr\u003eDriver Size: 10 mm dynamic drivers\u003cbr\u003eMicrophones: Dual mic + ENC \u003cbr\u003eControls: Smart Touch (MFB multi-function buttons)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose EVO Earbuds?\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe EVO Earbuds are engineered for those who thrive on individuality. With their metallic build, punchy 10 mm drivers, and ENC-enhanced voice clarity, EVO ensures your music and calls always sound as good as you look. Designed for expressive, everyday use. It’s not just another pair of earbuds, it’s your sound, your style, your EVO.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":50630768132374,"sku":"23463","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Milky White","offer_id":50630768197910,"sku":"23470","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":50630768165142,"sku":"23464","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ruby Red","offer_id":50630768230678,"sku":"23468","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":50630768099606,"sku":"23466","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/evo_jet-back_3.webp?v=1776686260"},{"product_id":"aero-earbuds","title":"Aero Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero Z-Buds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePackage Contains:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 1 pair of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/earbuds-zbuds\"\u003eearbud\u003c\/a\u003e, 1 charging cable, 1 user manual, 1 feature book, 1 warranty card\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero Z-Buds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero brings the essence of Zero Lifestyle’s sound engineering into a lighter, more compact form. Designed for creators, commuters, and everyday listeners, Aero delivers studio-grade clarity, seamless connectivity, and comfort that stays with you all day. Whether you’re in the zone, on the go, or winding down, Aero blends performance and elegance for the modern audio experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e13mm Boosted Super Driver\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero is powered by a 13mm boosted sound driver that enhances every beat with rich depth and crisp detail, creating a balanced audio experience that brings your playlists, calls, and podcasts to life.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eENC Function with Quad Mic\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWith Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) and a Quad Mic setup, Aero ensures your voice stays crystal clear during calls, even in noisy surroundings. Ideal for remote work, content creation, and everyday communication.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAI Voice Assistant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIntegrated AI voice support lets you control music, manage calls, and check updates effortlessly, all through simple voice commands without reaching for your phone.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLow Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWith just \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e45ms latency\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, Aero’s gaming mode synchronizes sound and visuals in real-time for uninterrupted gameplay and a competitive edge.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInstant Pairing\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero connects instantly the moment you open the case; no delays, no manual reconnecting. Smart pairing technology remembers your devices for a seamless start every time.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExtended Battery Life\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnjoy \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eup to 30 hours of total playtime\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e (including case) and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e5 hours on a single charge\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, supported by Type-C fast charging that gives \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e120 minutes of playtime in just 10 minutes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuilt to handle splashes, sweat, and light rain, Aero keeps up with your workouts and outdoor routines without compromise.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSensitive Touch Controls\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eManage music, calls, and gaming mode with a gentle tap; intuitive touch control ensures zero interruptions in your flow.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 5.4\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBT Range:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 15m\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpeaker Unit:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 13mm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 20–10kHz\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 32Ω\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEarbud Battery:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 30mAh\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCharging Case Battery:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 250mAh\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 1.5 hours\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Up to 5 hours on a single charge; 30 hours total with case\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCharging Input:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Type-C, DC 5V 0.3A\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBox Input:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e DC 5V 0.3A\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e IPX5\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecial Features:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 13mm boosted drivers, ENC with Quad Mic, AI Voice Assistant, Gaming Mode (45ms Low Latency), Instant Pairing, Type-C Fast Charging, 10-min quick charge = 120-min playtime, IPX5 water resistance, Sensitive Touch Controls\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose Aero Z-Buds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero Z-Buds redefine what everyday audio should feel effortless, expressive, and reliable. With immersive sound, powerful noise cancellation, and long-lasting performance, Aero keeps you connected to your rhythm wherever life takes you. From daily commutes to late-night edits, from workouts to work calls, Aero delivers clarity, comfort, and confidence, the Zero way.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Hyper Red","offer_id":51198922490134,"sku":"22281","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":51198932222230,"sku":"22270","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Space White","offer_id":51198931665174,"sku":"23064","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Aqua Green","offer_id":51198923211030,"sku":"23063","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":51198931730710,"sku":"23061","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Aero_Hyper-Red-4.webp?v=1766759359"},{"product_id":"navigator-smartwatch","title":"Navigator Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch3 data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"351\"\u003eNavigator Smartwatch – Precision GPS. Rugged Performance.\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"704\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"381\"\u003eNavigator \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch\u003c\/a\u003e is built for people who take accuracy seriously — from outdoor explorers to everyday athletes. With \u003cstrong data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"504\"\u003ehigh-precision GPS\u003c\/strong\u003e, advanced health sensors, and a \u003cstrong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"563\"\u003eworking rotating crown\u003c\/strong\u003e for ultra-smooth control, Navigator gives you powerful performance in a tough, outdoor-ready design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"704\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"relative inline-flex items-center\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eSpec - Navigator\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"709\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"748\"\u003e🔭 High-Precision GPS Tracking\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"889\"\u003eGo further with confidence. Navigator’s \u003cstrong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"827\"\u003eintegrated high-precision GPS chip\u003c\/strong\u003e tracks your route, pace, and distance with accuracy across:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"976\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"901\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"901\"\u003eWalking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"913\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"913\"\u003eRunning\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"925\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"925\"\u003eCycling\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"943\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"943\"\u003eTrail running\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"976\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"976\"\u003eHiking \/ on-foot exploration\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1016\"\u003eNo phone needed for location tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1021\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1070\"\u003e🎛 Working Rotating Crown + Sport Button\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1104\"\u003eNavigate your watch like a pro:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1125\"\u003eRotating crown\u003c\/strong\u003e to scroll menus, switch tiles, and zoom quickly\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1247\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1247\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1209\"\u003eDedicated Sport Mode button\u003c\/strong\u003e for one-tap access to your workouts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003eExtra \u003cstrong data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1271\"\u003eHome button\u003c\/strong\u003e for fast control in any situation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1400\"\u003eEven with gloves or sweaty hands, the physical controls keep everything under your command.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1405\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1454\"\u003e🌈 290+ Watch Faces \u0026amp; Full Customisation\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1477\"\u003eMake it truly yours:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1520\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1520\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1518\"\u003e5 default watch faces on the watch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1582\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1582\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1559\"\u003eOver 290+ additional watch faces\u003c\/strong\u003e available in the app\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003eDIY custom dials using your own photos, colours, and styles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003eYou can switch looks from sporty to formal in seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1707\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1755\"\u003e⚡ Magnetic Charging \u0026amp; Long Battery Life\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1820\"\u003eCharging is effortless with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1817\"\u003eincluded magnetic charger\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1882\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1882\"\u003eSimply snap the charger to the back – no ports, no hassle\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1903\"\u003e300mAh battery\u003c\/strong\u003e with up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1942\"\u003e3–5 days of typical use\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1980\"\u003eUp to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1978\"\u003e10–12 days on standby\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003eFull charge in about \u003cstrong data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e2.5–3 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2024\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2070\"\u003e🧠 Advanced Health \u0026amp; Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2123\"\u003eStay on top of your health with precision sensors:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2154\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2154\"\u003e24\/7 heart rate monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2187\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2187\"\u003eBlood oxygen (SpO2) tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2226\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2226\"\u003eBlood pressure \u0026amp; stress monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2259\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2259\"\u003eSleep tracking with insights\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2307\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2307\"\u003eBreath training modes (Relax \/ Fall asleep)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e100+ sports modes with detailed metrics (steps, kcal, duration, MET)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2383\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2427\"\u003e🖥 1.43\" AMOLED Display + Always-On\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2502\"\u003eEnjoy a vivid, sharp view with a \u003cstrong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2499\"\u003e1.43-inch AMOLED display (466×466)\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2535\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2535\"\u003eAlways-On Display clock mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2558\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2558\"\u003eFull touch control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003eCrisp, bright visuals indoors and outdoors\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2608\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2658\"\u003e📞 Smart Features That Keep You Connected\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2714\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2714\"\u003eBluetooth calling (dial\/answer\/reject on the watch)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2768\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2768\"\u003eApp notifications (social apps, SMS, calls, etc.)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2791\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2791\"\u003eAI voice assistant\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2843\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2843\"\u003eWeather, alarms, timers, stopwatch, world clock\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2906\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2906\"\u003eSedentary \/ drink water reminders, goal achievement alerts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2948\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2948\"\u003eRemote camera shutter \u0026amp; music control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003eFind my phone, DND \u0026amp; low power mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"2993\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3016\"\u003e💧 Built Tough\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3175\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3086\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3086\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3038\"\u003eIP68 waterproof\u003c\/strong\u003e – ready for sweat, splashes, and everyday use\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3137\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3137\"\u003eAluminum alloy + ABS frame, PC base, TPU strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3175\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3175\"\u003eComfortable 60.5g wearable weight\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black Red","offer_id":50750584226070,"sku":"23043","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green","offer_id":50750584291606,"sku":"23046","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Camou Gray","offer_id":50750584258838,"sku":"23047","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Orange","offer_id":50750584324374,"sku":"23044","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Beige","offer_id":50750584160534,"sku":"23048","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":50750584193302,"sku":"23045","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_d8b06a71-8b9c-4564-8344-11b83b4ca7b3.webp?v=1766048642"},{"product_id":"fusion-earbuds","title":"Fusion Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1 data-end=\"294\" data-start=\"246\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"294\" data-start=\"248\"\u003eFusion Earbuds – Pure Sound. Pure Freedom.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"638\" data-start=\"296\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-end=\"318\" data-start=\"300\"\u003eFusion Earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e are engineered for listeners who want powerful sound, seamless connectivity, and an ultra-comfortable in-ear design. Built with a \u003cstrong data-end=\"484\" data-start=\"449\"\u003e13mm copper-ring dynamic driver\u003c\/strong\u003e, dual microphones, Bluetooth 5.4, and a premium ergonomic fit, Fusion delivers an audio experience where clarity, comfort, and convenience come together.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"842\" data-start=\"640\"\u003eWhether you're working out, commuting, or winding down, Fusion keeps you immersed with deep bass, crisp vocals, and stable wireless performance—all wrapped inside a sleek, pocket-friendly charging case.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"880\" data-start=\"849\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"880\" data-start=\"852\"\u003ePremium Sound Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"881\"\u003ePowered by a \u003cstrong data-end=\"932\" data-start=\"894\"\u003eΦ13mm copper-ring membrane speaker\u003c\/strong\u003e, Fusion Earbuds deliver:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"960\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"979\" data-start=\"960\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"979\" data-start=\"962\"\u003eDeep, rich bass\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"996\" data-start=\"980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"996\" data-start=\"982\"\u003eClear vocals\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1015\" data-start=\"997\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1015\" data-start=\"999\"\u003eBalanced highs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1016\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1018\"\u003e20Hz–20kHz frequency response\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1050\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1052\"\u003e117dB sensitivity for crisp, high-resolution audio\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1143\" data-start=\"1106\"\u003ePerfect for music, movies, and calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1150\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1153\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1150\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1153\"\u003eCrystal-Clear Calling with Dual Mics\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1341\" data-start=\"1197\"\u003eEach earbud features \u003cstrong data-end=\"1238\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003edual microphones\u003c\/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1244\"\u003enoise-reduction support\u003c\/strong\u003e, ensuring your voice stays loud and clear—even in noisy environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1348\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1351\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1348\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1351\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1483\" data-start=\"1385\"\u003eEnjoy ultra-stable and fast connectivity with the latest \u003cstrong data-end=\"1480\" data-start=\"1442\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4 (JL 7006F4 platform)\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1691\" data-start=\"1484\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1505\" data-start=\"1484\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1505\" data-start=\"1486\"\u003e\u0026lt;1s Quick Pairing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1542\" data-start=\"1506\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1542\" data-start=\"1508\"\u003eAuto Pairing on opening the case\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1568\" data-start=\"1543\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1568\" data-start=\"1545\"\u003ePopup Pairing support\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1569\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1571\"\u003eHyper Sync for instant reconnect\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1569\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1571\"\u003e10m wireless transmission range\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1691\" data-start=\"1643\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1691\" data-start=\"1645\"\u003eSupports AVRCP, HFP, HSP, A2DP audio protocols\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1731\" data-start=\"1698\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"1731\" data-start=\"1701\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1731\" data-start=\"1698\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1731\" data-start=\"1701\"\u003eAll-Day Listening Power\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1732\"\u003eFusion keeps up with your routine thanks to strong battery life:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2043\" data-start=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1836\" data-start=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1836\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1814\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003e5.5 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e continuous playback\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1861\" data-start=\"1837\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1861\" data-start=\"1839\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1851\" data-start=\"1839\"\u003e90 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1891\" data-start=\"1862\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1891\" data-start=\"1864\"\u003eEarbud battery: \u003cstrong data-end=\"1889\" data-start=\"1880\"\u003e40mAh\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1892\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1894\"\u003eCharging case battery: \u003cstrong data-end=\"1927\" data-start=\"1917\"\u003e400mAh\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1965\" data-start=\"1930\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1965\" data-start=\"1932\"\u003eFull charge time: \u003cstrong data-end=\"1963\" data-start=\"1950\"\u003e1.5 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1990\" data-start=\"1966\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1990\" data-start=\"1968\"\u003eType-C fast charging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2024\" data-start=\"1991\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2024\" data-start=\"1993\"\u003eCharging case input: \u003cstrong data-end=\"2022\" data-start=\"2014\"\u003e1.5W\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2043\" data-start=\"2025\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2043\" data-start=\"2027\"\u003eOutput: \u003cstrong data-end=\"2043\" data-start=\"2035\"\u003e0.2W\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2082\" data-start=\"2050\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2082\" data-start=\"2053\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2082\" data-start=\"2050\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2082\" data-start=\"2053\"\u003eIPX4 Splash Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2168\" data-start=\"2083\"\u003eDesigned to handle sweat and light rain—ideal for workouts, commuting, and daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2204\" data-start=\"2175\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2204\" data-start=\"2178\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2204\" data-start=\"2175\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2204\" data-start=\"2178\"\u003eComfort Meets Style\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2361\" data-start=\"2205\"\u003eFusion Earbuds feature a lightweight TWS in-ear design that fits securely without fatigue.\u003cbr data-end=\"2298\" data-start=\"2295\"\u003eAvailable in premium colors:\u003cbr data-end=\"2329\" data-start=\"2326\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2361\" data-start=\"2329\"\u003eSilver, Red, Black, Gray\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2376\" data-start=\"2363\"\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2478\" data-start=\"2377\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2409\" data-start=\"2377\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2409\" data-start=\"2379\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2391\" data-start=\"2379\"\u003eEarbuds:\u003c\/strong\u003e 23 × 25 × 29 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2452\" data-start=\"2410\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2452\" data-start=\"2412\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2430\" data-start=\"2412\"\u003eCharging Case:\u003c\/strong\u003e 57 × 55.5 × 34.5 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2478\" data-start=\"2453\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2478\" data-start=\"2455\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2472\" data-start=\"2455\"\u003eTotal Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 46g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2509\" data-start=\"2485\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2509\" data-start=\"2488\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2509\" data-start=\"2485\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2509\" data-start=\"2488\"\u003eSmart Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2544\" data-start=\"2510\"\u003eFusion is built for convenience:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2761\" data-start=\"2545\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2577\" data-start=\"2545\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2577\" data-start=\"2547\"\u003eWake Siri \/ Google Assistant\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2622\" data-start=\"2578\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2622\" data-start=\"2580\"\u003eTouch controls (play\/pause, skip, calls)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2655\" data-start=\"2623\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2655\" data-start=\"2625\"\u003eCharging \u0026amp; status indicators\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2682\" data-start=\"2656\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2682\" data-start=\"2658\"\u003eMaster-slave switching\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2703\" data-start=\"2683\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2703\" data-start=\"2685\"\u003eAnti-loss prompt\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2761\" data-start=\"2704\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2761\" data-start=\"2706\"\u003eIn-ear detection (not supported—can remove if needed)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2768\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2771\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2768\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2771\"\u003eWhat’s Included\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2938\" data-start=\"2794\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2819\" data-start=\"2794\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2819\" data-start=\"2796\"\u003eFusion Earbuds (GM06)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2845\" data-start=\"2820\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2845\" data-start=\"2822\"\u003eType-C Charging Cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2861\" data-start=\"2846\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2861\" data-start=\"2848\"\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2879\" data-start=\"2862\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2879\" data-start=\"2864\"\u003eWarranty Card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2902\" data-start=\"2880\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2902\" data-start=\"2882\"\u003eGift Box Packaging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2919\" data-start=\"2903\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2919\" data-start=\"2905\"\u003eLogo Sticker\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2938\" data-start=\"2920\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2938\" data-start=\"2922\"\u003eWelcome Envelope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2963\" data-start=\"2945\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2963\" data-start=\"2948\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2963\" data-start=\"2945\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2963\" data-start=\"2948\"\u003ePerfect For\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3088\" data-start=\"2964\"\u003e✔ Daily listening\u003cbr data-end=\"2984\" data-start=\"2981\"\u003e✔ Gym \u0026amp; workouts\u003cbr data-end=\"3003\" data-start=\"3000\"\u003e✔ Travel \u0026amp; commute\u003cbr data-end=\"3024\" data-start=\"3021\"\u003e✔ Online meetings \u0026amp; calls\u003cbr data-end=\"3052\" data-start=\"3049\"\u003e✔ Students, professionals \u0026amp; gamers\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":50775231463702,"sku":"23386","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Black","offer_id":50775231430934,"sku":"23388","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Black","offer_id":50775231496470,"sku":"23391","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Red Black","offer_id":50775231398166,"sku":"23389","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/blue-black-1.webp?v=1771411142"},{"product_id":"opal-earbuds","title":"Opal ANC Earbuds","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"530\"\u003eDesigned for everyday performance and all-day comfort, these wireless earbuds deliver powerful sound, reliable connectivity, and long battery life in a sleek in-ear design. Available in \u003cstrong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"433\"\u003eBlack, White, Green, and Blue\u003c\/strong\u003e, they combine modern style with advanced audio technology to fit seamlessly into your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"825\"\u003ePowered by an \u003cstrong data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"564\"\u003eF11 audio unit\u003c\/strong\u003e and supporting \u003cstrong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"606\"\u003eSBC\/AAC audio decoding\u003c\/strong\u003e, the earbuds produce clear highs, balanced mids, and deep bass for music, calls, and streaming. With \u003cstrong data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"725\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e, you get faster pairing, stable connections, and low power consumption for uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"1105\"\u003eBuilt for convenience, the earbuds feature \u003cstrong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"898\"\u003esensitive touch controls\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"916\"\u003eauto pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"950\"\u003eindependent earbud usage\u003c\/strong\u003e with master-slave switching. Whether you’re answering calls, controlling music, or activating \u003cstrong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1073\"\u003eSiri or Google Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e, everything is just a tap away.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1333\"\u003eWith up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1148\"\u003e40 hours of total playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003eIPX4 water resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1208\"\u003elow-latency performance\u003c\/strong\u003e, these earbuds are ideal for daily use, workouts, travel, and casual gaming — offering reliable performance wherever you go.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Beige","offer_id":50996504690966,"sku":"23711","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":50996504658198,"sku":"23707","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Milky White","offer_id":50996504723734,"sku":"23709","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Opal_Beige-1.webp?v=1775561678"},{"product_id":"rover-elite-earbuds","title":"Rover Elite Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2\u003eRover Elite Earbuds – Power Meets Performance\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience high-quality sound, stable connectivity, and long-lasting battery life with the Rover Elite Earbuds. Built for everyday use, these earbuds offer a perfect balance of performance and comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSound Quality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy clear audio with deep bass and balanced output. With SBC and AAC support, the Rover Elite Earbuds deliver a smooth listening experience for music, calls, and videos.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe earbuds provide up to 7 hours of playtime on a single charge, with a total of up to 35 hours using the charging case. Fast charging ensures the earbuds are ready in about 45 minutes, while the case takes around 1.5 hours.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with Bluetooth 5.4, the Rover Elite Earbuds ensure a stable and fast connection with a range of over 10 meters. It also supports quick pairing and smooth device switching.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eLow Latency Mode\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith 60ms low latency, these earbuds are suitable for gaming and video streaming, keeping audio in sync with visuals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eCall Quality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDual microphones with ENC noise reduction help reduce background noise, providing clear voice calls in different environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIPX4 rating makes the earbuds resistant to sweat and light splashes, making them suitable for workouts and outdoor use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eControls\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTouch controls allow you to manage music, calls, volume, and voice assistants like Siri or Google Assistant easily.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDesign\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe earbuds feature a lightweight and ergonomic design for comfortable long-term use. Available in Beige, Blue, Green, and Black.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBox Contents\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLeft and right earbuds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUser manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWarranty card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUp to 35 hours total battery life\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBluetooth 5.4 connectivity\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLow latency for gaming\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eENC for clear calls\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComfortable and minimal design\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Shadow Black","offer_id":51123063783702,"sku":"24341","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Moss Green","offer_id":51123063750934,"sku":"24340","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ivory Beige","offer_id":51123063816470,"sku":"24339","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Arctic Sky","offer_id":51123063849238,"sku":"23887","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Rover-blackk-3.webp?v=1774434409"},{"product_id":"flow-earbuds","title":"Flow Zbuds","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"356\"\u003eThe ZERO Flow Earbuds are built for seamless audio, everyday comfort, and effortless connectivity. Designed for modern lifestyles, they deliver powerful sound, smart controls, and all-day convenience in a compact form.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-section-id=\"1sboupi\" data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"381\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"1131\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"17djwzr\" data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"462\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"410\"\u003ePremium Sound Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Crisp audio with deep bass and balanced clarity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1f21ur0\" data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"548\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"484\"\u003eNoise Reduction\u003c\/strong\u003e – Reduces background noise for better focus and clearer calls\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1hwist3\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"632\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"577\"\u003eBluetooth Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fast, stable, and instant pairing with all devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1h7h2r3\" data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"711\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"653\"\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Control music, calls, and functions with a simple tap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"f7ntnc\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"784\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"737\"\u003eBuilt-in Microphone\u003c\/strong\u003e – Clear voice quality for calls and meetings\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1sz22y3\" data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"854\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"809\"\u003eSingle \u0026amp; Dual Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Use one or both earbuds as per your need\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"g5zfhw\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"929\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"874\"\u003eErgonomic Fit\u003c\/strong\u003e – Comfortable and secure for long listening sessions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1jsvptw\" data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"997\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"958\"\u003eSweat-Resistant Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Perfect for workouts and daily use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1v9qucm\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1062\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1026\"\u003ePortable Charging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e – Easy charging anytime, anywhere\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"11djg2n\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1131\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1086\"\u003eLong Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Extended usage with charging case backup\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-section-id=\"1hz4s1p\" data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1162\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1344\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"9741mt\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1196\"\u003eCompact \u0026amp; lightweight design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1kbxqf4\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1233\"\u003eAuto-connect after first pairing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ttuwac\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1290\"\u003eCompatible with Android, iOS \u0026amp; all Bluetooth devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"zb1b6u\" data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1318\"\u003eCharging cable included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ugwij\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1344\"\u003eEasy to use interface\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1472\"\u003eThe ZERO Flow Earbuds combine performance, comfort, and convenience — making them the perfect everyday audio companion.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Flame Black","offer_id":51210276012310,"sku":"24419","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gray","offer_id":51210276045078,"sku":"24422","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pearl White","offer_id":51210276143382,"sku":"24423","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Black","offer_id":51210276077846,"sku":"24421","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green Black","offer_id":51210276110614,"sku":"24420","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/01_8ae65121-2039-4166-8b07-11512d29eacd.webp?v=1776250201"},{"product_id":"jewel-pro","title":"Jewel Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch1\u003eJewel Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted with a premium alloy body and a comfortable 18mm strap, the Jewel Pro carries a sleek 38.9mm dial while staying impressively light at just 29g. Built to handle daily life, it carries an IP68 water resistance rating so it keeps up with you through sweat, splashes, and rain.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVivid AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e Enjoy a larger 1.19-inch AMOLED screen with a sharp 390×390 resolution that delivers vibrant colors, deep contrast, and excellent clarity. With customizable menu view styles and an always-on display option, every glance feels premium.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by a 170mAh polymer battery, the Jewel Pro offers around 3 days of active use and up to 20 days on standby. Convenient magnetic wire charging tops it up fully in just 2 hours, getting you back on the move without delay.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Calling \u0026amp; NFC\u003c\/strong\u003e Take and make calls directly from your wrist thanks to the built-in speaker and Bluetooth calling chip. The integrated NFC support adds an extra layer of everyday convenience, keeping essential functions right at your fingertips.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/strong\u003e Effortlessly manage calls, notifications, and alerts straight from your wrist. With contact synchronization, call records, incoming call and message alerts, split-screen functionality, and find-device\/find-phone tools, the Jewel Pro ensures you never miss an important moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your experience with 91+ cloud-based watch faces (around 6 built-in), animated watch faces, and DIY watch face support — and choose from 120+ sports modes (15–20 built-in). Additional smart tools include Siri voice assistant support, music playback and control through the watch speaker, camera control, weather updates, alarms, flashlight, calculator, LCD brightness adjustment, theater\/DND mode, motion gesture wake, theme modes, stopwatch\/countdown, the built-in 2048 game, OTA firmware upgrades, and helpful reminders for sedentary behavior, hydration, and low battery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch AMOLED screen with 390×390 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 170mAh polymer battery — around 3 days active use, 20 days standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours (magnetic wire charging).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68 rating for dependable durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOperating System:\u003c\/strong\u003e Compatible with Android 6.0+ and iOS 12+.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e BT3.0 \/ BLE 5.4 with a 25-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e NFC support and Bluetooth calling.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMemory:\u003c\/strong\u003e 128M.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLanguages:\u003c\/strong\u003e 13 supported languages.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Jewel Pro Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Jewel Pro Smartwatch brings together refined design, a brilliant AMOLED display, and genuinely useful smart connectivity. With Bluetooth calling, NFC, comprehensive health tracking, and a deep set of everyday tools, it keeps you connected and in control — whether you're working out, powering through your day, or winding down at night.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Silver Gold Ring","offer_id":51268424925462,"sku":"24567","price":15999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Purple Ring","offer_id":51268424958230,"sku":"24571","price":15999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Ring","offer_id":51268424892694,"sku":"24569","price":15999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/ANGLE_01.webp?v=1782288247"}],"url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/collections\/best-sellers.oembed?page=2","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}